msgstr "Id provider do harness sở hữu (``ProviderView.provider``)."

#. module: npei_agent_harness
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:npei_agent_harness.field_npei_agent_provider__display_name
msgid "Human-readable provider name from ``llm.providers``."
